== of_the_intercept_alone
error[Z0401]: `plot` of a fit draws its coefficients beside the intercept, and this fit has none
 --> scripts/main.zeff:2:1
  |
2 | d.reg(y ~ 1).plot()
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^ a fit of the intercept alone
  |
  = help: `estimates()` gives the intercept with its interval as a frame

